title: RiP!: A Remix Manifesto
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

RiP! a Remix Manifesto is a documentary film.

Documentary about [[Intellectual Property]], [[Copyright]], and more!

Directed by [[Brett Gaylor]]. Its thesis is stated in [[The Remix Manifesto]].

Where to watch: http://www.nfb.ca/film/rip_a_remix_manifesto/ (more interesting if you're into copyright law, with a lot more detail and more "experts", but not as easily digestible as [[Everything is a Remix]]).
